  {"id":"intellect_q_5313","module":"intellect","type":"question","subtype":"true_false","grade_min":7,"grade_max":9,"difficulty":3,"tags":["chinese","名篇默写"],"subject":"chinese","stem":"\"山重水复疑无路，柳暗花明又一村\"出自陆游的《游山西村》。","stem_image":null,"options":null,"answer":true,"explanation":"这两句出自南宋诗人陆游的《游山西村》。","hint":"陆游是南宋诗人。","time_limit_seconds":15,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"intellect_q_5314","module":"intellect","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":7,"grade_max":9,"difficulty":5,"tags":["chinese","名篇默写"],"subject":"chinese","stem":"下列诗句中表达爱国情感的是？","stem_image":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"采菊东篱下，悠然见南山"},{"label":"B","text":"人生自古谁无死，留取丹心照汗青"},{"label":"C","text":"明月几时有，把酒问青天"},{"label":"D","text":"大漠孤烟直，长河落日圆"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"\"人生自古谁无死，留取丹心照汗青\"是文天祥的名句，表达了舍生取义的爱国精神。","hint":"哪句和报效国家有关？","time_limit_seconds":20,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"}
